#ASSERT `the points that count` 20 8 TRUE EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `the points that count` 20 8 FALSE EQUALS 28
#ASSERT `the further points before suspension` 30 FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the further points before suspension` 5 TRUE EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `the last day to show cause` 100 EQUALS 114

